# Shared Household Budget Targets

Monthly targets by category. The daily plan shows % used against these.

## Transaction source

- **Sheet ID:** {{BUDGET_SHEET_ID}}  <!-- Google Sheet your budgeting app exports to -->
- **Tab and range:** {{BUDGET_SHEET_RANGE}}  <!-- e.g. Primary!A1:P9000 -->
- **Columns:** date = {{DATE_COL}}, amount = {{AMOUNT_COL}}, category = {{CATEGORY_COL}}
- **Date format:** {{DATE_FORMAT}}  <!-- e.g. %m/%d/%Y -->
- **Sign convention:** negative amount = spending
- **Ignore categories:** Excluded, Transfer, Income

